# 📋 Project Status Tracking

## ⚠️ CRITICAL: Single Status Document

**There is ONE and ONLY ONE status document:**
```
docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md
```

**NEVER create additional status files. Always update this single document.**

### When to Update Status

Update after:
- ✅ Completing any task
- 🏗️ Making significant progress
- 🚀 Deploying (success or failure)
- ⚠️ Encountering issues
- 📋 Discussing future plans
- 🔄 Ending a session

